{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzupwb2h","slide":1,"name":"text","text":"CHESSTONG","textPreview":"CHESSTONG","textChars":9,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,72,340,44]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u18jqh0f","slide":1,"name":"text","text":"让国际象棋\n更容易听懂，\n也更容易坚持。","textPreview":"让国际象棋 | 更容易听懂， | 也更容易坚持。","textChars":20,"textLines":3,"bbox":[530,112,620,220]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jm1cfa9w","slide":1,"name":"text","text":"国际象棋智能学习平台项目计划书","textPreview":"国际象棋智能学习平台项目计划书","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[535,350,540,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/c7u54zid","slide":1,"name":"text","text":"我6岁开始学棋，因此很清楚初学者最难的不是兴趣，而是理解和坚持。","textPreview":"我6岁开始学棋，因此很清楚初学者最难的不是兴趣，而是理解和坚持。","textChars":32,"textLines":1,"bbox":[535,410,610,78]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/1orytsvu","slide":1,"name":"roundRect","bbox":[535,525,570,60]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u9knih4b","slide":1,"name":"text","text":"社会效益优先：从渝中到重庆，帮助更多初学者","textPreview":"社会效益优先：从渝中到重庆，帮助更多初学者","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[560,542,520,28]}
